1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:07,267
Imagine kijiye, aap online payment kar rahe hain, aur Pay
par tap karte hi aapke phone par ek SMS aata hai.

2
00:00:07,733 --> 00:00:11,500
Usmein ek 6-digit code hai, jo sirf kuch minutes
ke liye valid hai.

3
00:00:11,967 --> 00:00:16,367
Aap ye OTP enter karte hain, aur payment turant
confirm ho jaata hai.

4
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:23,833
Lekin ye code banta kahan hai, aapke phone tak kaise pahunchta
hai, aur bank ko kaise pata chalta hai ki code sahi hai?

5
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,667
Aaj hum OTP ke peeche ki technology ko, step by
step samjhenge.

6
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:33,500
Sabse pehle samajhte hain ki OTP actually hai
kya.

7
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:40,033
OTP ka full form hai One-Time Password, yaani
aisa password jo sirf ek baar kaam karta hai.

8
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:45,500
Aapka normal password lambe samay tak same rehta
hai, lekin OTP har baar naya banta hai.

9
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:48,300
Aur ye kuch hi minutes mein expire bhi ho jaata
hai.

10
00:00:48,467 --> 00:00:54,067
OTP ka use online payment, bank login, app sign up, aur
password reset jaisi jagahon par hota hai.

11
00:00:54,267 --> 00:00:57,233
Ise two-factor authentication ka hissa maana
jaata hai.

12
00:00:57,467 --> 00:01:01,600
Matlab, aapke paas sirf password hi nahi, balki
apna phone bhi hona chahiye.

13
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:08,333
Isliye agar kisi ko aapka password pata bhi chal jaaye,
to bhi OTP ke bina wo aage nahi badh paata.

14
00:01:08,533 --> 00:01:14,467
Kai apps mein OTP email par bhi aata hai, lekin
banking mein zyaadatar SMS OTP hi use hota hai.

15
00:01:16,267 --> 00:01:21,067
OTP system ko samajhne ke liye, pehle iske main
parts ko samajhte hain.

16
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:25,067
Pehla hai aapka app ya website, jahan aap login
ya payment kar rahe hain.

17
00:01:25,267 --> 00:01:30,800
Doosra hai bank ya company ka authentication
server, jo OTP banata aur check karta hai.

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,700
Teesra hai SMS gateway, jo server se message
lekar aage bhejta hai.

19
00:01:34,867 --> 00:01:39,700
Chautha hai aapka telecom operator, jiska
network SMS ko aapke phone tak pahunchata hai.

20
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:42,867
Aur paanchvaan hai aapka phone, jahan OTP aata
hai.

21
00:01:43,067 --> 00:01:47,100
In sabke beech har step par, data ko secure
rakhne ki koshish ki jaati hai.

22
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:49,967
Chaliye ab in steps ko ek-ek karke samajhte
hain.

23
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:54,200
Ab sawaal ye hai, OTP banta kaise hai?

24
00:01:54,367 --> 00:01:59,833
Jab aap Pay ya Login par tap karte hain, to
server ek random number banata hai.

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,767
Ye number aisa hota hai, jiska pehle se andaaza
lagana bahut mushkil ho.

26
00:02:03,967 --> 00:02:06,967
Iske liye secure random number generator ka use
hota hai.

27
00:02:07,167 --> 00:02:11,767
OTP aamtaur par chaar se aath digits ka hota
hai, aur zyaadatar chhah digits ka.

28
00:02:11,967 --> 00:02:18,000
Chhah digits mein kul das lakh combinations bante
hain, isliye guess karna bahut mushkil hai.

29
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:21,567
Phir server is OTP ko kuch details ke saath save
karta hai.

30
00:02:21,767 --> 00:02:26,900
Jaise, ye OTP kis user aur kis transaction ke
liye hai, aur kab expire hoga.

31
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:31,733
Kai systems OTP ko seedhe save karne ki jagah,
uska hash save karte hain.

32
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:38,233
Hash ek tarah ka digital fingerprint hai, jisse original
number wapas nikaalna bahut mushkil hota hai.

33
00:02:38,433 --> 00:02:43,300
Isse agar database tak koi pahunch bhi jaaye, to
use asli OTP aasaani se nahi milta.

34
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:48,667
OTP ki expiry aamtaur par kuch minutes ki hoti
hai, jaise paanch ya das minutes.

35
00:02:50,467 --> 00:02:53,500
Ab dekhte hain, OTP aapke phone tak kaise
pahunchta hai.

36
00:02:53,733 --> 00:02:57,300
Server, OTP waala message ek SMS gateway ko
bhejta hai.

37
00:02:57,467 --> 00:03:01,833
SMS gateway is message ko aapke telecom operator
ke network tak pahunchata hai.

38
00:03:02,033 --> 00:03:06,467
Operator ka SMS center, message ko store karke
aapke phone ko deliver karta hai.

39
00:03:06,667 --> 00:03:11,233
Aapka phone network se connected hai, isliye
message kuch hi seconds mein aa jaata hai.

40
00:03:11,433 --> 00:03:17,833
Banks message mein ek registered sender ID use karte
hain, taaki aap pehchaan sakein ki SMS asli hai.

41
00:03:18,033 --> 00:03:23,100
Kai phones mein OTP autofill hota hai, jismein
phone khud SMS se code padhkar bhar deta hai.

42
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:27,567
Kabhi-kabhi network busy hone par, OTP aane mein
thodi der bhi lag sakti hai.

43
00:03:27,767 --> 00:03:31,700
Roaming mein bhi, OTP aane mein kabhi-kabhi
zyaada time lag sakta hai.

44
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:37,600
Isiliye apps mein Resend OTP ka option hota hai,
jo kuch seconds baad active hota hai.

45
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:43,967
Ab aap OTP enter karte hain, to aage kya hota
hai?

46
00:03:44,167 --> 00:03:48,667
App aapka daala hua OTP, secure connection ke
zariye server ko bhejta hai.

47
00:03:48,867 --> 00:03:51,967
Server check karta hai ki OTP sahi hai ya nahi.

48
00:03:52,167 --> 00:03:56,967
Saath hi ye bhi dekhta hai ki OTP expire to nahi
hua, aur pehle use to nahi hua.

49
00:03:57,167 --> 00:04:01,267
Zyaadatar systems mein, galat OTP daalne ke
attempts bhi limited hote hain.

50
00:04:01,433 --> 00:04:07,567
Kuch galat attempts ke baad, OTP block ho sakta
hai, ya thodi der intezaar karna pad sakta hai.

51
00:04:07,767 --> 00:04:12,700
Agar sab sahi hai, to server approve karta hai,
aur aapka payment ya login poora ho jaata hai.

52
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:17,500
Aur ek baar use hone ke baad, wahi OTP dobaara
kaam nahi karta.

53
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:24,233
Payment waala OTP usi transaction se juda hota hai,
isliye kisi doosre payment mein kaam nahi aata.

54
00:04:24,433 --> 00:04:28,833
Card payments mein, ye verification aksar aapke
bank ke secure page par hota hai.

55
00:04:29,033 --> 00:04:33,233
Isi tarah login waala OTP bhi, usi login session
se juda hota hai.

56
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:40,333
Ab ek interesting baat. Kuch OTP SMS se nahi,
balki authenticator app mein bante hain.

57
00:04:40,567 --> 00:04:46,133
In apps mein har tees seconds mein ek naya code banta hai,
aur ye internet ke bina bhi kaam karte hain.

58
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:51,567
Ye TOTP method se chalta hai, yaani Time-based
One-Time Password.

59
00:04:51,767 --> 00:04:56,367
Setup ke samay, website aur aapki app, dono ek
secret key share karte hain.

60
00:04:56,567 --> 00:05:00,433
Aksar ye secret key, ek QR code scan karke app
mein save hoti hai.

61
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:05,100
Phir app, secret key aur current time ko
milakar, ek code calculate karta hai.

62
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:09,433
Server bhi usi secret key aur usi time se, same
calculation karta hai.

63
00:05:09,633 --> 00:05:13,667
Agar dono codes match ho jaayein, to login
approve ho jaata hai.

64
00:05:13,867 --> 00:05:18,667
Ye codes time par depend karte hain, isliye
phone ki time setting sahi hona zaroori hai.

65
00:05:18,867 --> 00:05:24,067
Server thode time difference ko bhi accept kar leta hai,
taaki chhoti si deri se login fail na ho.

66
00:05:24,267 --> 00:05:29,300
Aur ye SIM se juda nahi hota, isliye SIM swap jaise
fraud mein bhi zyaada safe maana jaata hai.

67
00:05:31,133 --> 00:05:35,133
OTP bahut useful hai, lekin fraud karne waale
bhi ise nishaana banaate hain.

68
00:05:35,333 --> 00:05:38,267
Sabse common tareeka hai, call karke OTP
maangna.

69
00:05:38,467 --> 00:05:43,600
Koi khud ko bank, delivery ya KYC team ka
batakar, OTP share karne ko kehta hai.

70
00:05:43,767 --> 00:05:48,067
Yaad rakhiye, bank kabhi bhi call ya message
karke aapka OTP nahi maangta.

71
00:05:48,267 --> 00:05:53,000
Doosra tareeka hai fake link, jahan ek nakli
website aapse OTP dalwaati hai.

72
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:57,633
Teesra tareeka hai SIM swap, jismein dhokhe se
aapke number ki nayi SIM nikalwaai jaati hai.

73
00:05:57,833 --> 00:06:01,700
Aise mein aapke OTP, fraud karne waale ke phone
par jaane lagte hain.

74
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:08,900
Agar achaanak aapke phone ka network chala jaaye, aur koi wajah
na dikhe, to turant apne operator se contact karein.

75
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:13,433
Screen share waale apps se bhi, fraud karne
waale aapka OTP dekh sakte hain.

76
00:06:13,633 --> 00:06:18,133
Isliye kisi anjaan ke kehne par, koi remote
access app install mat kijiye.

77
00:06:18,333 --> 00:06:24,100
Kuch log internet par fake customer care number bhi daal dete
hain, isliye number hamesha official website se hi lein.

78
00:06:25,933 --> 00:06:27,667
Ab kuch aasaan safety tips.

79
00:06:27,833 --> 00:06:32,500
OTP kabhi kisi ke saath share mat kijiye, chahe
saamne waala koi bhi ho.

80
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:37,333
OTP SMS ko dhyaan se padhiye, usmein amount aur
merchant ka naam check kijiye.

81
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:45,300
Agar aapne koi transaction shuru hi nahi kiya, aur OTP aaya
hai, to use ignore kijiye, aur bank ko bataiye.

82
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:50,700
Phone mein screen lock rakhiye, taaki notification
mein dikhne waala OTP koi aur na padh sake.

83
00:06:50,867 --> 00:06:54,400
Apne bank account mein, registered mobile number
hamesha updated rakhiye.

84
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:59,500
Jahan option ho, important accounts mein authenticator
app waala two-factor bhi on kar sakte hain.

85
00:06:59,667 --> 00:07:05,900
Aur fraud hone par, turant bank ko bataiye, aur
Cyber Crime Helpline 1930 par call kijiye.

86
00:07:06,100 --> 00:07:09,900
Aur bank ki taraf se aane waale alerts ko, kabhi
off mat kijiye.

87
00:07:11,733 --> 00:07:14,533
Aage chalkar, login ke aur bhi naye tareeke aa
rahe hain.

88
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:20,800
Jaise passkeys aur biometric login, jinmein
fingerprint ya face se verification hota hai.

89
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,833
Passkeys mein, fake website par login karwana
bahut mushkil ho jaata hai.

90
00:07:25,033 --> 00:07:28,633
Lekin aaj bhi, OTP security ki ek important
layer hai.

91
00:07:28,833 --> 00:07:34,833
To recap karein, server ek random OTP banata
hai, aur use expiry ke saath save karta hai.

92
00:07:35,033 --> 00:07:39,000
SMS gateway aur telecom network, use aapke phone
tak pahunchaate hain.

93
00:07:39,167 --> 00:07:43,933
Aap OTP enter karte hain, server use check karta
hai, aur approve kar deta hai.

94
00:07:44,133 --> 00:07:51,033
Agar aapko technology ke peeche ke aise systems samajhna achha lagta
hai, to video ko like kijiye, aur channel ko subscribe kijiye.

95
00:07:51,233 --> 00:07:53,267
Milte hain agle video mein. Thank you!
